","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-07-29","period":"2026-06-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789019/000119312526323660/msft-20260630.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Microsoft is a technology company committed to making digital technology and artificial intelligence (\"AI\") available broadly and doing so responsibly. Our mission is to empower every person and every organization on the planet to achieve more.","zh":"Microsoft 是一家科技公司，致力於以負責任的方式廣泛提供數位技術和人工智慧 (“AI”)。我們的使命是幫助地球上的每個人和每個組織取得更大成就。"},{"en":"We develop and support a broad portfolio of technology solutions for individuals and businesses, focusing on secure, trusted, and innovative platforms and applications that meet evolving customer needs across AI, cloud computing, productivity and collaboration, and personal computing. We strive to create opportunity, growth, and impact in every country around the world.","zh":"我們為個人和企業開發並支援廣泛的技術解決方案組合，專注於安全、可信任和創新的平台和應用程序，以滿足人工智慧、雲端運算、生產力和協作以及個人運算方面不斷變化的客戶需求。我們努力為世界每個國家創造機會、成長和影響力。"},{"en":"AI is fundamentally transforming productivity for every individual, organization, and industry. Microsoft's AI offerings span every layer of the technology stack, enabling transformative outcomes across sectors and unlocking opportunity for every country, community, and individual.","zh":"人工智慧正在從根本上改變每個個人、組織和產業的生產力。微軟的人工智慧產品涵蓋技術堆疊的每一層，實現跨產業的變革成果，並為每個國家、社群和個人釋放機會。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our success is based on our ability to create new and compelling products, services, and experiences for our users, initiate and embrace disruptive technology trends, enter new geographic and product markets, and drive broad adoption of our products and services. We make significant investments in research and development for new and existing products, services, and technologies, including tools and platforms spanning digital work and life experiences, cloud computing, AI, devices, security, and operating systems.","zh":"我們的成功是基於我們為用戶創造新的、引人注目的產品、服務和體驗的能力，發起和擁抱顛覆性技術趨勢，進入新的地理和產品市場，並推動我們的產品和服務的廣泛採用。我們對新產品和現有產品、服務和技術的研發進行了大量投資，包括涵蓋數位工作和生活體驗、雲端運算、人工智慧、設備、安全和作業系統的工具和平台。"},{"en":"We develop most of our products and services internally which allows us to maintain competitive advantages that come from product differentiation and closer technical control over our products and services. It also gives us the freedom to decide which modifications and enhancements are most important and when they should be implemented. We strive to obtain information as early as possible about changing usage patterns and hardware advances that may affect software and hardware design. Before releasing new software platforms, and as we make significant modifications to existing platforms, we provide application vendors with a range of resources and guidelines for development, training, and testing.","zh":"我們的大部分產品和服務都是在內部開發的，這使我們能夠保持來自產品差異化和對產品和服務更嚴格的技術控制的競爭優勢。它還使我們能夠自由地決定哪些修改和增強是最重要的以及何時實施它們。我們努力儘早獲取有關可能影響軟體和硬體設計的使用模式變化和硬體進步的資訊。在發布新的軟體平台之前，當我們對現有平台進行重大修改時，我們為應用程式供應商提供一系列用於開發、培訓和測試的資源和指南。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Microsoft 365 Consumer is designed to increase personal productivity and creativity through a range of products and services. Growth depends on our ability to reach new users, add value to our core product set with new features including AI tools, and continue to expand our product and service offerings into new markets. Microsoft 365 Consumer cloud revenue and Office Consumer products revenue is mainly affected by the percentage of customers that buy Office with their new devices and the continued shift from Office licensed on-premises to Microsoft 365 Consumer subscriptions. Microsoft 365 Consumer cloud revenue is also affected by the demand for communication and storage through Outlook.com and OneDrive, which is largely driven by subscriptions and advertising.","zh":"Microsoft 365 Consumer 旨在透過一系列產品和服務提高個人生產力和創造力。成長取決於我們吸引新用戶的能力，透過人工智慧工具等新功能為我們的核心產品增加價值，以及繼續將我們的產品和服務擴展到新市場的能力。 Microsoft 365 消費者雲端收入和 Office 消費者產品收入主要受到透過新裝置購買 Office 的客戶百分比以及從 Office 本地授權向 Microsoft 365 消費者訂閱的持續轉變的影響。 Microsoft 365 消費者雲端收入也受到透過 Outlook.com 和 OneDrive 進行通訊和儲存的需求的影響，而這主要是由訂閱和廣告驅動的。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Competitors to Office include software and global application vendors, web-based and mobile application companies, AI-first application companies, as well as local application developers. We compete by providing secure, integrated industry-specific, and easy-to-use productivity and collaboration tools and services that create comprehensive solutions and work well with technologies our customers already have both on-premises or in the cloud.","zh":"Office 的競爭對手包括軟體和全球應用程式供應商、基於 Web 和行動應用程式的公司、人工智慧優先的應用程式公司以及本地應用程式開發人員。我們透過提供安全、整合的行業特定且易於使用的生產力和協作工具和服務來競爭，這些工具和服務創建全面的解決方案，並與我們的客戶在本地或雲端中已有的技術很好地配合。"},{"en":"Windows faces competition from various software products and from alternative platforms and devices. Microsoft Defender for Endpoint competes with endpoint security solution providers.","zh":"Windows 面臨來自各種軟體產品以及替代平台和裝置的競爭。 Microsoft Defender for Endpoint 與端點安全解決方案提供者競爭。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Productivity & Business Processes","val":139996000000,"zh":"生產力和業務流程"},{"name":"Intelligent Cloud","val":137791000000,"zh":"智慧雲"},{"name":"More Personal Computing","val":54052000000,"zh":"更多個人計算"}],"total":331839000000},"prod":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Service Other","val":267143000000,"zh":"服務其他"},{"name":"Server Products & Cloud Services","val":129425000000,"zh":"伺服器產品和雲端服務"},{"name":"Microsoft Three Six Five Commercial Products & Cloud Services","val":101997000000,"zh":"Microsoft 三、六五商業產品與雲端服務"},{"name":"XBOX","val":21790000000,"zh":"XBOX"},{"name":"Linked In Corporation","val":19817000000,"zh":"領英公司"},{"name":"Windows & Devices","val":17084000000,"zh":"Windows 和裝置"},{"name":"Search Advertising","val":15176000000,"zh":"搜尋廣告"},{"name":"Microsoft Three Six Five Consumer Products & Cloud Services","val":9175000000,"zh":"Microsoft 三六五消費產品與雲端服務"},{"name":"Dynamics Products & Cloud Services","val":9006000000,"zh":"動力學產品和雲端服務"},{"name":"Enterprise & Partner Services","val":8260000000,"zh":"企業及合作夥伴服務"}],"total":331839000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"US","val":170794000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":161045000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":331839000000}},"peers":["AAPL","AMZN","GOOG","NVDA","META"]}}